The union of the study region and the interacting/ external region ist the considered region.</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An interacting region role is a role of a region of relevance that interacts with a region of relevance that has the study region role. It is part of a region of relevance that has the considered region role, but not a study region role.</obo:IAO_0000115>
