        <obo:IAO_0000115>Nature of model uncertainty is a quality of a model that represents the core reason for uncertainty within it.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.researchgate.net/publication/264816512_Classifying_and_communicating_uncertainties_in_model-based_policy_analysis</obo:IAO_0000119>
