        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A protected area role is a role of a region of relevance recognised, dedicated and managed through legal or other effective means, to achieve the long term conservation of nature with associated ecosystem services and cultural values.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>Definition partly adapted from IUCN protected area category V: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IUCN_protected_area_categories#Category_V_%E2%80%93_protected_landscape_or_seascape</obo:IAO_0000119>
