        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A biosphere reserve is a protected area that has the biosphere reserve role, i.e. it is protected for conserving biodiversity, promoting sustainable development, and supporting research and education, within the UNESCO &quot;Man and the Biosphere&quot; (MAB) Programme.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000118 xml:lang="de">Biosphärenreservat</obo:IAO_0000118>
