        <obo:IAO_0000115>Epistemological uncertainty is a nature of model uncertainty that stems from a lack of knowledge about a certain phenomenon.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000118 xml:lang="en">epistemology of uncertainty</obo:IAO_0000118>
