        <obo:IAO_0000115>Deep uncertainty is a level of model uncertainty at which one can enumerate multiple alternatives, without being able to rank them in order of likelihood.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.researchgate.net/publication/264816512_Classifying_and_communicating_uncertainties_in_model-based_policy_analysis</obo:IAO_0000119>
